sumables, parts and spares which make the product operational. \"),i.qZA(),i.TgZ(17,\"h4\",4),i._uU(18,\" Extended Producer Responsibility \"),i.qZA(),i.TgZ(19,\"p\"),i._uU(20,\"The extended producer responsibility for each product shall be decided on the basis of the information provided by the producers on the portal and the individual product\\u2019s life period. Producers have to fulfill their extended producer responsibility targets as per Schedule-III and Schedule-IV of the above said Rules through the portal. \"),i._UZ(21,\"br\"),i._uU(22,\" The producer shall fulfill their extended producer responsibility through online purchase of extended producer responsibility certificate from registered recyclers only and submit it online by filing quarterly return.\"),i.qZA(),i.TgZ(23,\"h4\",4),i._uU(24,\" Online E-Waste Management System \"),i.qZA(),i.TgZ(25,\"p\"),i._uU(26,\" Extended Producer Responsibility (EPR) of producers are regulated through grant of Registration Certificate and issue Recycling Targets / EPR obligation.\\n\"),i._UZ(27,\"br\"),i._uU(28,\"\\nFor Registration Certificate and Recycling Targets / EPR Obligation producers under these Rules (definition given below) are required to apply on the EPR Portal at the URL eprewastecpcb.in to CPCB.\\n\"),i._UZ(29,\"br\"),i._uU(30,\"\\nThis E-Waste EPR Portal is an online E-Waste Management System, where applicant producers can apply online for grant of Registration Certificate and Recycling Targets / EPR obligation. All the stakeholders like Producer, Recyclers, Refurbishers and Manufacturers are required to register themselves on this system. The CPCB shall generate Extended Producer Responsibility Registration Certificate of Producers through the portal in favour of a Producer on receiving the required information on the portal as per the SOP.\\n\"),i._UZ(31,\"br\"),i._uU(32,\"\\nThe producer shall fulfill their extended producer responsibility through online purchase of extended producer responsibility certificate from registered recyclers only have to submit it online by filing quarterly return.\\n\"),i._UZ(33,\"br\"),i._uU(34,\"\\n\\u2018Producer\\u2019 means any person who, irrespective of the selling technique used such as dealer, retailer, e-retailer, etc. (i) manufactures and offers to sell electrical and electronic equipment and their components or consumables or parts or spares under its own brand or (ii) offers to sell under its own brand, assembled electrical and electronic equipment and their components or consumables or parts or spares produced by other manufacturers or suppliers or (iii) offers to sell imported electrical and electronic equipment and their components or consumables or parts or spares. \"),i.qZA()()(),i._UZ(35,\"app-footer\"))},dependencies:[Ui.g,Zt.c],styles:[\".bxpage[_ngcontent-%COMP%]{font-size:14px;padding:50px 0}.h4-text[_ngcontent-%COMP%]{margin:10px 0 0!important;line-height:1.5!important}@media (max-width: 768px){.bxpage[_ngcontent-%COMP%]{padding:20px 0}.h4-text[_ngcontent-%COMP%]{line-height:1.3!important}}\"]}),Ge})(),Br=(()=>{class Ge{}return Ge.\\u0275fac=function(D){return new(D||Ge)},Ge.\\u0275cmp=i.Xpm({type:Ge,selectors:[[\"app-epr-target\"]],decls:121,vars:0,consts:[[1,\"bxpage\",\"epr-target\"],[1,\"container\",\"targ-bx-mn\"],[1,\"targ-bx\"],[1,\"h3-text\"],[1,\"h4-text\"],[1,\"table\",\"table-bordered\"],[\"scope\",\"col\"],[1,\"italics\"],[1,\"italic\"]],template:function(D,j){1&D&&(i.TgZ(0,\"div\",0)(1,\"div\",1),i._UZ(2,\"app-downtime\"),i.TgZ(3,\"div\",2)(4,\"h3\",3),i._uU(5,\" SCHEDULE III \"),i.qZA(),i.TgZ(6,\"h4\",4),i._uU(7,\"[See rules 3(m), 6(2), 13(1), 13(2)] \"),i.qZA(),i.TgZ(8,\"table\",5)(9,\"caption\"),i._uU(10,\"Data Table\"),i.qZA(),i.TgZ(11,\"thead\")(12,\"tr\")(13,\"th\",6),i._uU(14,\"Sr. No.\"),i.qZA(),i.TgZ(15,\"th\",6),i._uU(16,\"Year (Y)\"),i.qZA(),i.TgZ(17,\"th\",6),i._uU(18,\"E-Waste Recycling Target (by weight)\"),i.qZA()()(),i.TgZ(19,\"tbody\")(20,\"tr\")(21,\"td\"),i._uU(22,\"i. \"),i.qZA